(5050063, 735531, 96751, '<td valign="top">Been there...</td>', 'Been there...', '2008-11-07 03:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050064, 736616, 96751, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to see the smoke.  Maybe a different angle with less going on behind the smoke would have been better.</td>', 'It took me a while to see the smoke.  Maybe a different angle with less going on behind the smoke would have been better.', '2008-11-07 03:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050066, 736603, 96751, '<td valign="top">Just like a jellyfish!  Gorgeous</td>', 'Just like a jellyfish!  Gorgeous', '2008-11-07 03:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050067, 735775, 96751, '<td valign="top">This seems....miraculous!  Beautiful</td>', 'This seems....miraculous!  Beautiful', '2008-11-07 03:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050068, 735534, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but a little flat</td>', 'Great idea, but a little flat', '2008-11-07 03:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050069, 736617, 96751, '<td valign="top">This looks like the three stooges!</td>', 'This looks like the three stooges!', '2008-11-07 03:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050070, 736686, 96751, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable pooch, but he overshadows the smoke.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable pooch, but he overshadows the smoke.', '2008-11-07 03:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050071, 736366, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, interesting rotation.</td>', 'Great contrast, interesting rotation.', '2008-11-07 03:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050075, 736621, 96751, '<td valign="top">Superb!  Great angle, color, sharpness, geometry.</td>', 'Superb!  Great angle, color, sharpness, geometry.', '2008-11-07 03:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050076, 736412, 96751, '<td valign="top">too much of this is out of focus.</td>', 'too much of this is out of focus.', '2008-11-07 03:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050164, 736654, 7786, '<td valign="top">Þetta er mjög flott mynd hjá þér. Skemmtilegur reykur. En hvernig fórstu að því að taka mynd upp á Hveravöllum í snjólausu í síðustu viku! Ég verð að efast um að þessi mynd sé tekin innan tímaramma keppninnir.</td>', 'Þetta er mjög flott mynd hjá þér. Skemmtilegur reykur. En hvernig fórstu að því að taka mynd upp á Hveravöllum í snjólausu í síðustu viku! Ég verð að efast um að þessi mynd sé tekin innan tímaramma keppninnir.', '2008-11-07 07:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050421, 735921, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like the different colors in the swirls....</td>', 'I like the different colors in the swirls....', '2008-11-07 11:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050424, 736709, 98339, '<td valign="top">Looks like my shoes when I take them off...really liked it..</td>', 'Looks like my shoes when I take them off...really liked it..', '2008-11-07 11:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050427, 736525, 98339, '<td valign="top">really like the colors and the swirls...</td>', 'really like the colors and the swirls...', '2008-11-07 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050429, 736621, 98339, '<td valign="top">for once I like the planes and the smoke...nice and sharp</td>', 'for once I like the planes and the smoke...nice and sharp', '2008-11-07 11:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050430, 735195, 98339, '<td valign="top">They seem be be dancing....</td>', 'They seem be be dancing....', '2008-11-07 11:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050433, 736616, 98339, '<td valign="top">The last of the pumpkins....good angle</td>', 'The last of the pumpkins....good angle', '2008-11-07 11:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050435, 736023, 98339, '<td valign="top">Seems out of control...like the exposure and the silhouette</td>', 'Seems out of control...like the exposure and the silhouette', '2008-11-07 11:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050547, 736684, 100286, '<td valign="top">I always find myself drawn to curves, and this is no exception. I like the way this one keeps drawing my eye to the smallest whirl near the center.</td>', 'I always find myself drawn to curves, and this is no exception. I like the way this one keeps drawing my eye to the smallest whirl near the center.', '2008-11-07 12:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050559, 736598, 74015, '<td valign="top">Lots of atmosphere.  I just wish we could see her eyes more clearly.</td>', 'Lots of atmosphere.  I just wish we could see her eyes more clearly.', '2008-11-07 12:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050563, 736719, 74015, '<td valign="top">Excellent title and good pattern in the smoke.</td>', 'Excellent title and good pattern in the smoke.', '2008-11-07 12:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050568, 735973, 74015, '<td valign="top">Sooooooo spooky...  This is one of the most powerful image in this challenge.</td>', 'Sooooooo spooky...  This is one of the most powerful image in this challenge.', '2008-11-07 12:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050570, 735799, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great image and duotone work.  I wish the smoke had more presence.</td>', 'Great image and duotone work.  I wish the smoke had more presence.', '2008-11-07 12:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050575, 736511, 74015, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.  My only complaint: I wish she was holding the violin correctly.  Like this, it looks like just a prop in her hands (which it probably is :) but I would like to be able to believe it a little).</td>', 'This is excellent.  My only complaint: I wish she was holding the violin correctly.  Like this, it looks like just a prop in her hands (which it probably is :) but I would like to be able to believe it a little).', '2008-11-07 12:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050577, 736030, 52472, '<td valign="top">Well done, I like your choice of colours. This shot was certainly not simple as I guess it''s a double exposure. Maybe it is too complex though.</td>', 'Well done, I like your choice of colours. This shot was certainly not simple as I guess it''s a double exposure. Maybe it is too complex though.', '2008-11-07 12:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050578, 736686, 74015, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the smoke effect is very effective but you got my attention with the weird bokeh you have going on in the background.  I''ll be returning to this after voting to see what lens/camera you use.  And the dog is just so cute!</td>', 'I don''t think the smoke effect is very effective but you got my attention with the weird bokeh you have going on in the background.  I''ll be returning to this after voting to see what lens/camera you use.  And the dog is just so cute!', '2008-11-07 12:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050584, 736466, 74015, '<td valign="top">I am always amazed to see the feminine figures that come up in smoke...  This one is well executed although it looks a little oversharpened (some jpeg artefacts can be seen in the "butt-thigh" area of her "body".</td>', 'I am always amazed to see the feminine figures that come up in smoke...  This one is well executed although it looks a little oversharpened (some jpeg artefacts can be seen in the "butt-thigh" area of her "body".', '2008-11-07 12:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050589, 736316, 74015, '<td valign="top">Finally!! An original take on smoke.  Great colors.</td>', 'Finally!! An original take on smoke.  Great colors.', '2008-11-07 12:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050594, 736674, 74015, '<td valign="top">You have a good subject.  I am just left wondering if another composition would have been more dynamic.  Maybe steeping a little closer to the tower (if possible)?  Still I like the colors and the originality of your subject.</td>', 'You have a good subject.  I am just left wondering if another composition would have been more dynamic.  Maybe steeping a little closer to the tower (if possible)?  Still I like the colors and the originality of your subject.', '2008-11-07 12:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050597, 735970, 74015, '<td valign="top">Very, very cOOl!!</td>', 'Very, very cOOl!!', '2008-11-07 12:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050600, 736725, 74015, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see the smoke in here.  There''s so little of it, it could very weel be just a reflection on water or some kind of light painting.</td>', 'I don''t really see the smoke in here.  There''s so little of it, it could very weel be just a reflection on water or some kind of light painting.', '2008-11-07 12:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050602, 736637, 52472, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose, the expression and the lighting. Personally, I think that a close-up of a drag is fairly uninteresting. If I was any good at portraits, I would put a smoker into a context, a story, where he "freezes a moment in time" with his cigarette.</td>', 'I really like the pose, the expression and the lighting. Personally, I think that a close-up of a drag is fairly uninteresting. If I was any good at portraits, I would put a smoker into a context, a story, where he "freezes a moment in time" with his cigarette.', '2008-11-07 12:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050604, 736473, 74015, '<td valign="top">Original perspective that sets you apart from the rest of the "puffin'' shots".  The B&amp;W conversion is also very good.</td>', 'Original perspective that sets you apart from the rest of the "puffin'' shots".  The B&W conversion is also very good.', '2008-11-07 12:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050605, 736716, 74015, '<td valign="top">I see the cigarette but no smoke...</td>', 'I see the cigarette but no smoke...', '2008-11-07 12:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050610, 736366, 74015, '<td valign="top">Excellent B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'Excellent B&W conversion.', '2008-11-07 12:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050613, 734885, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s a very good snap-shot. But if you could freely choose, I guess you would do a lot of things different, like angle of view, focal length, slower shutter speed,...</td>', 'It''s a very good snap-shot. But if you could freely choose, I guess you would do a lot of things different, like angle of view, focal length, slower shutter speed,...', '2008-11-07 12:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050614, 736495, 74015, '<td valign="top">LOL!  The winner for originality in interpreting the theme! The lighting looks a little harsh but it could be my monitor.</td>', 'LOL!  The winner for originality in interpreting the theme! The lighting looks a little harsh but it could be my monitor.', '2008-11-07 12:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050617, 735531, 74015, '<td valign="top">NOPE!!  Hope you backed up...</td>', 'NOPE!!  Hope you backed up...', '2008-11-07 12:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050620, 736262, 74015, '<td valign="top">This image is proof that images don''t have to be technically perfect to be beautiful.  The dense, gloomy, turn-of-the-century atmosphere of this shot speaks volume... it could be used by Greenpeace in an anti-pollution campaign.  Very strong!</td>', 'This image is proof that images don''t have to be technically perfect to be beautiful.  The dense, gloomy, turn-of-the-century atmosphere of this shot speaks volume... it could be used by Greenpeace in an anti-pollution campaign.  Very strong!', '2008-11-07 12:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050635, 736744, 52472, '<td valign="top">Technically very well done. The composition is not perfect, for instance the screw thread on the bulb is not well lit and could as well not be framed. That''s probably only because I remember kiwiness'' version.</td>', 'Technically very well done. The composition is not perfect, for instance the screw thread on the bulb is not well lit and could as well not be framed. That''s probably only because I remember kiwiness'' version.', '2008-11-07 12:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050637, 736453, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s not the most exciting subject, but it''s very well done.</td>', 'It''s not the most exciting subject, but it''s very well done.', '2008-11-07 13:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050640, 735599, 52472, '<td valign="top">Technically it is bad. Not sharp, low contrast, poor lighting. Still gave you a 6 because it''s a cool idea and probably very hard to implement!</td>', 'Technically it is bad. Not sharp, low contrast, poor lighting. Still gave you a 6 because it''s a cool idea and probably very hard to implement!', '2008-11-07 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050676, 736464, 30791, '<td valign="top">ahhh my brain is hurting triyng to figure out how you did this<br/>10</td>', 'ahhh my brain is hurting triyng to figure out how you did this10', '2008-11-07 13:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050682, 735970, 30791, '<td valign="top">top finisher for sure, good luck</td>', 'top finisher for sure, good luck', '2008-11-07 13:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050749, 736612, 98339, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the curves in this picture...</td>', 'I really like the colors and the curves in this picture...', '2008-11-07 14:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050751, 735970, 98339, '<td valign="top">Very creative....</td>', 'Very creative....', '2008-11-07 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050827, 736674, 52472, '<td valign="top">The chimney is somewhat dwarfed by your composition and out of context. Otherwise it''s perfect, I like your processing.</td>', 'The chimney is somewhat dwarfed by your composition and out of context. Otherwise it''s perfect, I like your processing.', '2008-11-07 15:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050831, 736473, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s not a very flattering angle of view and portraits should always be flattering, shouldn''t they? Otherwise all good!</td>', 'It''s not a very flattering angle of view and portraits should always be flattering, shouldn''t they? Otherwise all good!', '2008-11-07 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050841, 736525, 52472, '<td valign="top">I think the only way of lighting glasses is from behind. With a black background it means cutting out the background or covering the light source to match the glass shape! Not anything I''m going to do very soon, but it would almost certainly would have won you a ribbon! (IMveryHO)</td>', 'I think the only way of lighting glasses is from behind. With a black background it means cutting out the background or covering the light source to match the glass shape! Not anything I''m going to do very soon, but it would almost certainly would have won you a ribbon! (IMveryHO)', '2008-11-07 15:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050843, 736739, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s a pitty the upper part is not sharp, because you have nice shapes there. Still a solid smoke picture though.</td>', 'It''s a pitty the upper part is not sharp, because you have nice shapes there. Still a solid smoke picture though.', '2008-11-07 15:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050850, 736262, 52472, '<td valign="top">Now that''s real smoldering grey smoke, the real stuff instead of the coloured little fumes in the other entries :)</td>', 'Now that''s real smoldering grey smoke, the real stuff instead of the coloured little fumes in the other entries :)', '2008-11-07 15:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050864, 736725, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s a good abstract picture, simple and very esthetic</td>', 'It''s a good abstract picture, simple and very esthetic', '2008-11-07 15:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050866, 735747, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit a pitty that you have this 2 guys in the background who do not seem to care. That''s not your fault of course, good shot.</td>', 'It''s a bit a pitty that you have this 2 guys in the background who do not seem to care. That''s not your fault of course, good shot.', '2008-11-07 15:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050878, 736736, 52472, '<td valign="top">Everything is very esthetic. Nice lighting, reflection, smoke shape. The composition does not really emphasize the smoke, which makes it innocuous.</td>', 'Everything is very esthetic. Nice lighting, reflection, smoke shape. The composition does not really emphasize the smoke, which makes it innocuous.', '2008-11-07 15:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050905, 736583, 52472, '<td valign="top">Very solid composition. Might be interesting to have a somewhat wider DOF in order to see the gaze.</td>', 'Very solid composition. Might be interesting to have a somewhat wider DOF in order to see the gaze.', '2008-11-07 15:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050930, 734844, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s a good shot, no problem. The lighting is a bit harsh for me. Could be cool to see the tip of the nose of the smoker, but stop I begin to ramble...</td>', 'It''s a good shot, no problem. The lighting is a bit harsh for me. Could be cool to see the tip of the nose of the smoker, but stop I begin to ramble...', '2008-11-07 16:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050962, 736598, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s more psychedelic than scary, which makes it quite strange, but not in a bad way.</td>', 'It''s more psychedelic than scary, which makes it quite strange, but not in a bad way.', '2008-11-07 16:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050966, 736311, 52472, '<td valign="top">Great smoke shapes, nice and sharp. I feel that the shutter speed was to slow, it looks somewhat like a double exposure.</td>', 'Great smoke shapes, nice and sharp. I feel that the shutter speed was to slow, it looks somewhat like a double exposure.', '2008-11-07 16:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050972, 735799, 52472, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the yellow tone and smoke has quite a minor role. It stays a very good portrait though.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the yellow tone and smoke has quite a minor role. It stays a very good portrait though.', '2008-11-07 16:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050974, 735799, 100161, '<td valign="top">outstanding image!  I am always torn with a shot like this deciding how much of the shadows to expose.  Too much and you loose the mystery, too little and you loose frame of reference.  This image looks almost perfect, I might have exposed a touch more in those dark mids.   well done!</td>', 'outstanding image!  I am always torn with a shot like this deciding how much of the shadows to expose.  Too much and you loose the mystery, too little and you loose frame of reference.  This image looks almost perfect, I might have exposed a touch more in those dark mids.   well done!', '2008-11-07 16:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050977, 735775, 52472, '<td valign="top">Cool smoke rolls. The lighting is quite dull on the left side, maybe you should have cropped.</td>', 'Cool smoke rolls. The lighting is quite dull on the left side, maybe you should have cropped.', '2008-11-07 16:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050980, 736351, 100161, '<td valign="top">great light!</td>', 'great light!', '2008-11-07 16:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050987, 735216, 52472, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it''s exactly about, but it has an arty touch which I like.</td>', 'Not sure what it''s exactly about, but it has an arty touch which I like.', '2008-11-07 16:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050990, 734891, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s a good composition, maybe not at the best time of the day.</td>', 'It''s a good composition, maybe not at the best time of the day.', '2008-11-07 16:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050993, 736427, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s good picture, nothing wrong, but I feel the subject is not the smoke which escapes the composition.</td>', 'It''s good picture, nothing wrong, but I feel the subject is not the smoke which escapes the composition.', '2008-11-07 16:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5050994, 736716, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s not really a picture about smoke, not even about smoking (yes I know the Marlboro man). But it''s a nice shot of a man and his horse.</td>', 'It''s not really a picture about smoke, not even about smoking (yes I know the Marlboro man). But it''s a nice shot of a man and his horse.', '2008-11-07 16:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051004, 735708, 52472, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s certainly original but doesn''t make any kind of sense. For being nicely surrealistic I would start with a better title.</td>', 'Well, it''s certainly original but doesn''t make any kind of sense. For being nicely surrealistic I would start with a better title.', '2008-11-07 16:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051019, 736225, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice composition but I would like to see a bit more of the nice curves of this kettle.</td>', 'It''s a nice composition but I would like to see a bit more of the nice curves of this kettle.', '2008-11-07 16:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051029, 736597, 52472, '<td valign="top">The composition feels a bit wrong. It''s certainly because of the huge task you set yourself: it''s already hard enough to control the shape of one single fume!</td>', 'The composition feels a bit wrong. It''s certainly because of the huge task you set yourself: it''s already hard enough to control the shape of one single fume!', '2008-11-07 16:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051045, 736366, 52472, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit too much smoke for my taste, I don''t believe potatoes can get that angry. Otherwise good.</td>', 'There''s a bit too much smoke for my taste, I don''t believe potatoes can get that angry. Otherwise good.', '2008-11-07 16:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051056, 736659, 52472, '<td valign="top">A car which drives into the border of the frame looks wrong to me. It should have some open road in front to give a feeling of speed and freedom, or it needs an airbag.</td>', 'A car which drives into the border of the frame looks wrong to me. It should have some open road in front to give a feeling of speed and freedom, or it needs an airbag.', '2008-11-07 16:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051082, 736351, 52472, '<td valign="top">Capital. Dare I ask where you keep it?<br/> <br/>The light rays seem a bit random, maybe a little less smoke would have been more, but it''s hard to say without trying. That brings me back to my initial point, you should lend it to me.<br/> <br/>And I should stop rambling, I''m trying to do 100% comment and it begins to be late.</td>', 'Capital. Dare I ask where you keep it? The light rays seem a bit random, maybe a little less smoke would have been more, but it''s hard to say without trying. That brings me back to my initial point, you should lend it to me. And I should stop rambling, I''m trying to do 100% comment and it begins to be late.', '2008-11-07 17:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051176, 736612, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. The smoke looks sculptured. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot. The smoke looks sculptured. 10', '2008-11-07 17:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051179, 735195, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.10</td>', 'Beautiful shot.10', '2008-11-07 17:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
