(5055059, 735531, 91282, '<td valign="top">This is great! I work in the tech industry and have refurbished SO MANY of those Compaqs that setting them on fire has passed through my mind many, many times. ;D *sends link to this photo to all her tech friends*</td>', 'This is great! I work in the tech industry and have refurbished SO MANY of those Compaqs that setting them on fire has passed through my mind many, many times. ;D *sends link to this photo to all her tech friends*', '2008-11-10 14:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055063, 735775, 91282, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. My only suggestion would be maybe to crop so just the right side (the right-most 3 swirls) are in the frame. The lighter swirls aren''t as well detailed.</td>', 'This is beautiful. My only suggestion would be maybe to crop so just the right side (the right-most 3 swirls) are in the frame. The lighter swirls aren''t as well detailed.', '2008-11-10 14:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
