(5055065, 736685, 97166, '<td valign="top">Either you couldn''t find an older model, or this is some sort of social commentary, but it is still horribly off-putting.  Especially considering the smoke seems like a tacked-on afterthought to me.</td>', 'Either you couldn''t find an older model, or this is some sort of social commentary, but it is still horribly off-putting.  Especially considering the smoke seems like a tacked-on afterthought to me.', '2008-11-10 14:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055067, 736490, 97166, '<td valign="top">Whatever the plant-thing in the background is, (probably a plant?), it is horribly distracting and fights tooth and nail with the smoke for domination of this photo.</td>', 'Whatever the plant-thing in the background is, (probably a plant?), it is horribly distracting and fights tooth and nail with the smoke for domination of this photo.', '2008-11-10 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
