(5055296, 736262, 85014, '<td valign="top">Oversharpening Machine: Using Photoshop as a machine of sharpening and only that; to set all the levels in Unsharp Mask at their highest levels so as to seek an unrealistic picture; "That guys computer is an Oversharpening Machine and is trying to overcompensate for his softly composed and out of focus images."</td>', 'Oversharpening Machine: Using Photoshop as a machine of sharpening and only that; to set all the levels in Unsharp Mask at their highest levels so as to seek an unrealistic picture; "That guys computer is an Oversharpening Machine and is trying to overcompensate for his softly composed and out of focus images."', '2008-11-10 15:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
