(5055325, 736730, 85014, '<td valign="top">Try to move the bulb further from the end of the glass table next time and close up your aperture. This will get rid of that line behind the bulb. Also, try using more light and lighting from different angles, this light didn''t really work for the smoke as it is very hard to see here...</td>', 'Try to move the bulb further from the end of the glass table next time and close up your aperture. This will get rid of that line behind the bulb. Also, try using more light and lighting from different angles, this light didn''t really work for the smoke as it is very hard to see here...', '2008-11-10 16:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055327, 736464, 85014, '<td valign="top">Great idea</td>', 'Great idea', '2008-11-10 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055330, 736666, 85014, '<td valign="top">Ha Probably could have done a better job with the background and composition here, but I am giving you a 9 cuz I am so tired of looking at the same thing over and over and have not seen something funny and creative and well, even just different! Thank You!</td>', 'Ha Probably could have done a better job with the background and composition here, but I am giving you a 9 cuz I am so tired of looking at the same thing over and over and have not seen something funny and creative and well, even just different! Thank You!', '2008-11-10 16:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
