(5055491, 736511, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and I like the control of the high key half.  As an orchestra teacher I just have to point out that the instrument hold &amp; position could be more convincing if she just had her <a href="//images.google.com/images?rlz=1C1GGLS_en-USUS294&amp;sourceid=chrome&amp;ie=UTF-8&amp;q=violin%20bow%20hold&amp;um=1&amp;sa=N&amp;tab=wi" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pinky on top of the bow</a> and held the <a href="//images.google.com/images?um=1&amp;hl=en&amp;rlz=1C1GGLS_en-USUS294&amp;q=violin+hold&amp;btnG=Search+Images" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">instrument between her shoulder &amp; jaw</a>.  Still, it''s nice to see a good picture with a violin.</td>', 'Great contrast and I like the control of the high key half.  As an orchestra teacher I just have to point out that the instrument hold & position could be more convincing if she just had her pinky on top of the bow and held the instrument between her shoulder & jaw.  Still, it''s nice to see a good picture with a violin.', '2008-11-10 18:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
