(5055646, 735799, 77196, '<td valign="top">No vote. I can''t bring myself to penalize this shot because the smoke is hardly visible, and almost totally blends into the background. Great expression and tantalizing lighting on the sax. Makes me want to sit with my eyes closed and just listen. This would make a proud addition to any portfolio.</td>', 'No vote. I can''t bring myself to penalize this shot because the smoke is hardly visible, and almost totally blends into the background. Great expression and tantalizing lighting on the sax. Makes me want to sit with my eyes closed and just listen. This would make a proud addition to any portfolio.', '2008-11-10 20:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
