(5057952, 735599, 65234, '<td valign="top">Creative idea and I like that the smoke is green.  Not sure why I like that, but I do.  Skull is softly dark, which doesn''t quite work for me.  A gleaming skull works better to emphasize the bits that aren''t there (like eyeballs).</td>', 'Creative idea and I like that the smoke is green.  Not sure why I like that, but I do.  Skull is softly dark, which doesn''t quite work for me.  A gleaming skull works better to emphasize the bits that aren''t there (like eyeballs).', '2008-11-11 20:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
