(5058789, 736430, 44878, '<td valign="top">Its probably difficult for you to understand this photograph, because it was a scene in a Show, some people said maybe different angle ect.<br/>It was very very Dark and the Stage Smoke if ever yo have seen it is very hard for Focusing.<br/> <br/>So with that in Mind I did nt take this photo with the Purpose of looking for a Photo to do well in a Challenge, But to be fair I have been Hanging on and Hangin on in Here, I think Time is Up for me now, because there was some sensible people around who use to give great advice.<br/>Where have they gone !<br/>I am sure some of you will jump on this and say what is expected because of my disspointment.<br/>But Fifth Last ?<br/>See Ya</td>', 'Its probably difficult for you to understand this photograph, because it was a scene in a Show, some people said maybe different angle ect.It was very very Dark and the Stage Smoke if ever yo have seen it is very hard for Focusing. So with that in Mind I did nt take this photo with the Purpose of looking for a Photo to do well in a Challenge, But to be fair I have been Hanging on and Hangin on in Here, I think Time is Up for me now, because there was some sensible people around who use to give great advice.Where have they gone !I am sure some of you will jump on this and say what is expected because of my disspointment.But Fifth Last ?See Ya', '2008-11-12 04:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
