(5059662, 735799, 73564, '<td valign="top">Love the emotion in the eyes, this is a very stong image, Nice work! Edit to add: There is smoke showing, and a jazzy picture automatically makes me think of a smokey night club (imo) and if you were to give more room above the head it would have made up for the space on the right. I really thought this would have been front page if not top 10 at least, I like this idea more than just plain smoke. There are tons of pictures on this site that don''t get the credit they deserve. (Its a pisser but its something we deal with.)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-13 17:38:15.</i></td>', 'Love the emotion in the eyes, this is a very stong image, Nice work! Edit to add: There is smoke showing, and a jazzy picture automatically makes me think of a smokey night club (imo) and if you were to give more room above the head it would have made up for the space on the right. I really thought this would have been front page if not top 10 at least, I like this idea more than just plain smoke. There are tons of pictures on this site that don''t get the credit they deserve. (Its a pisser but its something we deal with.)', '2008-11-12 11:46:48.000000', '2008-11-13 17:38:15.000000', 0),
